    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. You've reached VeloFit, my name is Isaac. How can I assist you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767401745266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to make a return.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 37773,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767401751599999
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly help with that. To pull up your account, could I please get your order number?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767401753399999
    },
    {
