      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 37773,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767401759866665
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you. Let me pull that up... Okay, I see the ClubFit Helmet, delivered on December 19th. That was 14 days ago. To proceed, could you tell me what specifically is the issue? Is it a technical fault or more of a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767401761799998
    },
    {
      "text": "The color is just... wrong. Not what I wanted.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 37773,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767401777066664
    },
    {
      "text": "I see. We definitely want you to be happy with your gear. Can you confirm for me that the item is still in its original condition?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767401780333330
