      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 37773,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767401789199996
    },
    {
      "text": "Perfect, thank you for clarifying. Please give me just one moment to review the return eligibility for this item.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767401792533329
    },
    {
      "text": "Alright, I've checked the policy. Since your helmet is a standard VeloFit item and it's well within the 90-day return period, I can approve this return for a full refund right now. We believe safety is paramount, and that includes being comfortable with the gear you're wearing.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
