      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767401800266662
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine. So what's next?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 37773,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767401818999995
    },
    {
      "text": "I have just emailed a pre-paid return shipping label to the address on file. You can print that out, attach it to the original package, and drop it off at any local shipping center. Once our warehouse receives it, your refund will be issued.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
